OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are political parties
OL,4,Apromising to do to help young people
OL,5,Afind work?
OL,6,
OL,7,FAcross the West Midlands, there are
OL,8,F79,840 young people aged 16 to 24 who
OL,9,Fare not in employment, education or
OL,10,Ftraining - otherwise known as Neets.
OL,12,FWhen it comes to young people claiming
OL,13,Funemployment benefits, six of the top
OL,14,F10 constituencies in the entire country
OL,15,Fare in Birmingham.
OL,17,FIn fact, there are now so many 16-24
OL,18,Fyear olds out of work, education or
OL,19,Ftraining in Birmingham and the Black
OL,20,FCountry that they could fill every seat
OL,21,Fin Villa Park.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
